{
  "dom_id": "step-16029",
  "name": "Calculating the Magnitude of a Vector Using the Law of Cosines",
  "problem": "When the triangle law for addition does *not* give a right triangle, we *cannot* use the Pythagorean theorem to compute the magnitude of the sum.\n\nFor example, using the triangle law to draw the sum $\\mathbf{a}+\\mathbf{b}$ for the vectors below, we do not get a right triangle. Instead, we get a triangle with an obtuse angle $\\theta.$\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/linear/14251078/assets/967966ec9d8ac0b7358623645de0e7931ef4d6cc87bd919d1f0cf04f7ca6ca28.png)\n\nWe do not obtain a right triangle here, so we cannot use the Pythagorean theorem. However, we can use the law of cosines:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{|a+b|}^{2} & ={|a|}^{2}+{|b|}^{2}-2|a||b|\\operatorname{cos}⁡\\theta \\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nIn general, given any two vectors that form a triangle using the triangle addition law, we can always use the law of cosines to compute the magnitude of the sum.",
  "worked_solution": "",
  "calculator_instructions": "",
  "fields": [],
  "problem_field_keys": [],
  "answer_fields_complete": null,
  "result": null,
  "proof_feedback": null,
  "html": "<div id=\"step-16029\" class=\"step\" style=\"display: block\" stepid=\"16029\" steptype=\"tutorial\" contentid=\"2962\">\n            <div class=\"stepHeader\">\n                <div class=\"stepName\">\n                    <a id=\"stepAnchor-16029\" class=\"stepAnchor\" name=\"step-8\">Calculating the Magnitude of a Vector Using the Law of Cosines</a>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"helpButton\" stepid=\"16029\">?</div>\n            </div> \n\n            <style type=\"text/css\">\n                            .mjpage .MJX-monospace {\n                            font-family: monospace\n                            }\n\n                            .mjpage .MJX-sans-serif {\n                            font-family: sans-serif\n                            }\n\n                            .mjpage {\n                            display: inline;\n                            font-style: normal;\n                            font-weight: normal;\n                            line-height: normal;\n                            font-size: 100%;\n                            font-size-adjust: none;\n                            text-indent: 0;\n                            text-align: left;\n                            text-transform: none;\n                            letter-spacing: normal;\n                            word-spacing: normal;\n                            word-wrap: normal;\n                            white-space: nowrap;\n                            float: none;\n                            direction: ltr;\n                            max-width: none;\n                            max-height: none;\n                            min-width: 0;\n                            min-height: 0;\n                            border: 0;\n                            padding: 0;\n                            margin: 0\n                            }\n\n                            .mjpage * {\n                            transition: none;\n                            -webkit-transition: none;\n                            -moz-transition: none;\n                            -ms-transition: none;\n                            -o-transition: none\n                            }\n\n                            .mjx-svg-href {\n                            fill: blue;\n                            stroke: blue\n                            }\n\n                            .MathJax_SVG_LineBox {\n                            display: table!important\n                            }\n\n                            .MathJax_SVG_LineBox span {\n                            display: table-cell!important;\n                            width: 10000em!important;\n                            min-width: 0;\n                            max-width: none;\n                            padding: 0;\n                            border: 0;\n                            margin: 0\n                            }\n\n                            .mjpage__block {\n                            text-align: center;\n                            margin: 1em 0em;\n                            position: relative;\n                            display: block!important;\n                            text-indent: 0;\n                            max-width: none;\n                            max-height: none;\n                            min-width: 0;\n                            min-height: 0;\n                            width: 100%\n                            }</style><p>When the triangle law for addition does <em>not</em> give a right triangle, we <em>cannot</em> use the Pythagorean theorem to compute the magnitude of the sum.</p>\n<p>For example, using the triangle law to draw the sum <span class=\"mjpage\"><svg xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\" width=\"5.625ex\" height=\"2.343ex\" style=\"vertical-align: -0.505ex;\" viewBox=\"0 -791.3 2421.9 1008.6\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" aria-labelledby=\"MathJax-SVG-1-Title\">\n<title id=\"MathJax-SVG-1-Title\">\\mathbf{a}+\\mathbf{b}</title>\n<defs aria-hidden=\"true\">\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E1-MJMAINB-61\" d=\"M64 349Q64 399 107 426T255 453Q346 453 402 423T473 341Q478 327 478 310T479 196V77Q493 63 529 62Q549 62 553 57T558 31Q558 9 552 5T514 0H497H481Q375 0 367 56L356 46Q300 -6 210 -6Q130 -6 81 30T32 121Q32 188 111 226T332 272H350V292Q350 313 348 327T337 361T306 391T248 402T194 399H189Q204 376 204 354Q204 327 187 306T134 284Q97 284 81 305T64 349ZM164 121Q164 89 186 67T238 45Q274 45 307 63T346 108L350 117V226H347Q248 218 206 189T164 121Z\"></path>\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E1-MJMAIN-2B\" d=\"M56 237T56 250T70 270H369V420L370 570Q380 583 389 583Q402 583 409 568V270H707Q722 262 722 250T707 230H409V-68Q401 -82 391 -82H389H387Q375 -82 369 -68V230H70Q56 237 56 250Z\"></path>\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E1-MJMAINB-62\" d=\"M32 686L123 690Q214 694 215 694H221V409Q289 450 378 450Q479 450 539 387T600 221Q600 122 535 58T358 -6H355Q272 -6 203 53L160 1L129 0H98V301Q98 362 98 435T99 525Q99 591 97 604T83 620Q69 624 42 624H29V686H32ZM227 105L232 99Q237 93 242 87T258 73T280 59T306 49T339 45Q380 45 411 66T451 131Q457 160 457 230Q457 264 456 284T448 329T430 367T396 389T343 398Q282 398 235 355L227 348V105Z\"></path>\n</defs>\n<g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n <use xlink:href=\"#E1-MJMAINB-61\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E1-MJMAIN-2B\" x=\"781\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E1-MJMAINB-62\" x=\"1782\" y=\"0\"></use>\n</g>\n</svg></span> for the vectors below, we do not get a right triangle. Instead, we get a triangle with an obtuse angle <span class=\"mjpage\"><svg xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\" width=\"1.737ex\" height=\"2.176ex\" style=\"vertical-align: -0.338ex;\" viewBox=\"0 -791.3 748 936.9\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" aria-labelledby=\"MathJax-SVG-2-Title\">\n<title id=\"MathJax-SVG-2-Title\">\\theta.</title>\n<defs aria-hidden=\"true\">\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E2-MJMATHI-3B8\" d=\"M35 200Q35 302 74 415T180 610T319 704Q320 704 327 704T339 705Q393 701 423 656Q462 596 462 495Q462 380 417 261T302 66T168 -10H161Q125 -10 99 10T60 63T41 130T35 200ZM383 566Q383 668 330 668Q294 668 260 623T204 521T170 421T157 371Q206 370 254 370L351 371Q352 372 359 404T375 484T383 566ZM113 132Q113 26 166 26Q181 26 198 36T239 74T287 161T335 307L340 324H145Q145 321 136 286T120 208T113 132Z\"></path>\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E2-MJMAIN-2E\" d=\"M78 60Q78 84 95 102T138 120Q162 120 180 104T199 61Q199 36 182 18T139 0T96 17T78 60Z\"></path>\n</defs>\n<g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n <use xlink:href=\"#E2-MJMATHI-3B8\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E2-MJMAIN-2E\" x=\"469\" y=\"0\"></use>\n</g>\n</svg></span></p>\n<div id=\"graphic-2c45d99520f09fb1356b8998b226fccb\" class=\"graphic\"><img src=\"/graphics/2c45d99520f09fb1356b8998b226fccb\"></div>\n\n<p>We do not obtain a right triangle here, so we cannot use the Pythagorean theorem. However, we can use the law of cosines:</p>\n<p><span class=\"mjpage mjpage__block\"><svg xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\" width=\"37.526ex\" height=\"3.176ex\" style=\"vertical-align: -1.005ex;\" viewBox=\"0 -934.9 16157 1367.4\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" aria-labelledby=\"MathJax-SVG-3-Title\">\n<title id=\"MathJax-SVG-3-Title\">\n<mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" display=\"true\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"4\" style=\"font-size: 113.1%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math display=\"true\" class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"margin-left: 0px; margin-right: 0px;\"><mjx-mtable style=\"min-width: 15.769em;\"><mjx-table><mjx-itable><mjx-mtr><mjx-mtd style=\"text-align: right; padding-right: 0px;\"><mjx-msup><mjx-texatom texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c7C\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-texatom texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-b\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D41A TEX-B\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-b\" space=\"3\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2B TEX-B\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-b\" space=\"3\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D41B TEX-B\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-texatom><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c7C\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo></mjx-texatom><mjx-script style=\"vertical-align: 0.477em;\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\" size=\"s\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c32\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-script></mjx-msup><mjx-tstrut></mjx-tstrut></mjx-mtd><mjx-mtd style=\"text-align: left; padding-left: 0px;\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-n\"></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"4\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c3D\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-msup space=\"4\"><mjx-texatom texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-texatom texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-b\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c7C TEX-B\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-b\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D41A TEX-B\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-b\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c7C TEX-B\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo></mjx-texatom></mjx-texatom><mjx-script style=\"vertical-align: 0.477em;\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\" size=\"s\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c32\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-script></mjx-msup><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"3\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2B\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-msup space=\"3\"><mjx-texatom texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-texatom texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-b\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c7C TEX-B\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-b\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D41B TEX-B\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-b\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c7C TEX-B\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo></mjx-texatom></mjx-texatom><mjx-script style=\"vertical-align: 0.477em;\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\" size=\"s\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c32\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-script></mjx-msup><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"3\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2212\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"3\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c32\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn><mjx-texatom texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-b\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c7C TEX-B\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-b\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D41A TEX-B\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-texatom texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-b\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c7C TEX-B\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo></mjx-texatom><mjx-texatom texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-b\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c7C TEX-B\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo></mjx-texatom><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-b\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D41B TEX-B\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-b\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c7C TEX-B\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo></mjx-texatom><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"2\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c63\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c6F\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c73\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2061\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\" space=\"2\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D703 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-tstrut></mjx-tstrut></mjx-mtd></mjx-mtr></mjx-itable></mjx-table></mjx-mtable></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"block\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><mtable displaystyle=\"true\" columnalign=\"right left\" columnspacing=\"0em\" rowspacing=\"3pt\"><mtr><mtd><msup><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mo stretchy=\"false\">|</mo><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">a</mi><mo mathvariant=\"bold\">+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">b</mi></mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">|</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup></mtd><mtd><mi></mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mo mathvariant=\"bold\" stretchy=\"false\">|</mo><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">a</mi><mo mathvariant=\"bold\" stretchy=\"false\">|</mo></mrow></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mo mathvariant=\"bold\" stretchy=\"false\">|</mo><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">b</mi><mo mathvariant=\"bold\" stretchy=\"false\">|</mo></mrow></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mo mathvariant=\"bold\" stretchy=\"false\">|</mo><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">a</mi><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mo mathvariant=\"bold\" stretchy=\"false\">|</mo></mrow><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mo mathvariant=\"bold\" stretchy=\"false\">|</mo></mrow><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">b</mi><mo mathvariant=\"bold\" stretchy=\"false\">|</mo></mrow><mi>cos</mi><mo data-mjx-texclass=\"NONE\">⁡</mo><mi>θ</mi></mtd></mtr></mtable></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container>\n</title>\n<defs aria-hidden=\"true\">\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E3-MJMAIN-7C\" d=\"M139 -249H137Q125 -249 119 -235V251L120 737Q130 750 139 750Q152 750 159 735V-235Q151 -249 141 -249H139Z\"></path>\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E3-MJMAINB-61\" d=\"M64 349Q64 399 107 426T255 453Q346 453 402 423T473 341Q478 327 478 310T479 196V77Q493 63 529 62Q549 62 553 57T558 31Q558 9 552 5T514 0H497H481Q375 0 367 56L356 46Q300 -6 210 -6Q130 -6 81 30T32 121Q32 188 111 226T332 272H350V292Q350 313 348 327T337 361T306 391T248 402T194 399H189Q204 376 204 354Q204 327 187 306T134 284Q97 284 81 305T64 349ZM164 121Q164 89 186 67T238 45Q274 45 307 63T346 108L350 117V226H347Q248 218 206 189T164 121Z\"></path>\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E3-MJMAINB-2B\" d=\"M64 232T64 250T87 281H416V444Q416 608 418 612Q426 633 446 633T475 613Q477 608 477 444V281H807Q808 280 811 278T817 274T823 269T827 262T829 251Q829 230 807 221L642 220H477V57Q477 -107 475 -112Q468 -131 446 -131Q425 -131 418 -112Q416 -107 416 57V220H251L87 221Q64 232 64 250Z\"></path>\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E3-MJMAINB-62\" d=\"M32 686L123 690Q214 694 215 694H221V409Q289 450 378 450Q479 450 539 387T600 221Q600 122 535 58T358 -6H355Q272 -6 203 53L160 1L129 0H98V301Q98 362 98 435T99 525Q99 591 97 604T83 620Q69 624 42 624H29V686H32ZM227 105L232 99Q237 93 242 87T258 73T280 59T306 49T339 45Q380 45 411 66T451 131Q457 160 457 230Q457 264 456 284T448 329T430 367T396 389T343 398Q282 398 235 355L227 348V105Z\"></path>\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E3-MJMAIN-32\" d=\"